OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster jailed over #300k travel
OL,4,Ainsurance claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fraudster who claimed more than
OL,7,F#300,000 in a series of bogus travel
OL,8,Finsurance claims has been jailed for
OL,9,Ffour and a half years.
OL,11,FClaims submitted by 46-year-old Daniel
OL,12,FThomas, from Reading, included saying
OL,13,Fhe was injured in a crash and
OL,14,Fcontracted salmonella during family
OL,15,Fholidays to Antigua.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
