OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1788528372
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster jailed over #300k travel
OL,4,Ainsurance claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FDirect Line Group, the Post Office and
OL,7,FGreat Lakes Insurance SE were among
OL,8,Fthose defrauded, with the scam only
OL,9,Fcoming to light when the National Crime
OL,10,FAgency investigated his alleged role in
OL,11,Fsabotaging a drugs trial, uncovering
OL,12,Fkey evidence.
OL,14,FAlready in prison for another offence,
OL,15,Fhe admitted to fraud by
OL,16,Fmisrepresentation and money laundering.
OL,17,FHe was sentenced at Southwark Crown
OL,18,FCourt on Tuesday.
